WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Select needed columns. A SELECT query reads data. Choose columns that answer your question.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Filter the result. WHERE keeps only rows matching the condition.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Make order explicit. ORDER BY requests a predictable output order.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Bind application values. Bind user values as parameters. Do not paste them into SQL text.
